        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9045, Traditional Cabinet Knob with Concave Center</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Omnia Industries, this traditional cabinet knob features a concave center that brings a sense of dramatic appeal to the entire piece. The ridged shape of this cabinet door knob brings movement to the piece that translates into glamorous beauty. Little details such as the ridges and the middle really come together to produce the beautiful and timeless Concave Center Traditional Cabinet Door Knob.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Concave Cabinet Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9045/25</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9045/31</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9045/38</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/lion-head-door-stop.jpg?v=1704354585\" width=\"514\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
